    <div class="section" id="s3">
      <h2 class="section-title">3. Types of Hash Algorithms</h2>
      <p>Over the decades, many hashing algorithms have been developed. Each generation has improved on the weaknesses
        of the last.</p>

      <h3 class="sub-title">Algorithm Comparison Table</h3>
      <table class="hash-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Algorithm</th>
            <th>Output Size</th>
            <th>Speed</th>
            <th>Security Level</th>
